#               decl.md (Seam pre-review `3d910bc`; §6.5 TICK 4
#               charter; §4 movement ⇔ frame-bounded epoch STRONG
#               binding via Bateson-grading),
#               docs/audits/2026-07-06-seam-phase-d-arc-6-tick-3-song-
#               voice-and-s3-promotion.md (Seam Phase D at TICK 3
#               close; documents #S3 PROMOTED CANDIDATE → LANDED at
